，开发者可以上手试试这版，帮忙在正式发布前踩掉最后的坑。</description><pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 12:00:00 GMT</pubDate><guid isPermaLink="false">270614230fa813bad205fa25ab925543ee01d8e8</guid><source url="https://godotengine.org/article/dev-snapshot-godot-4-8-beta-5">Godot 引擎博客</source></item></channel></rss>
